[compiler-rt][sanitizer] Remove linux/scc.h

Backport of upstream LLVM commit 3dc4fd6dd411 (llvm/llvm-project#194116),
which is on intel/llvm's `sycl` branch but not on the v7.0.0 release branch.

Linux 7.x removed <linux/scc.h> along with the AX.25 SCC drivers, so
nixpkgs' linuxHeaders >= 7.1 no longer ships it and sanitizer_common
fails to compile. Drop the include and the two struct size probes that
depend on it.

Can be dropped once the pin moves to a release that carries the fix.

